# ============================================================================
# SYNTHETIC FIXTURE - NOT a recorded device session.
# Hand-written to exercise scripts/evaluate-live-session.py. No device, model or
# throughput claim rests on this file. Its EVIDENCE requirement fails on purpose.
#
# Fixture intent: every depth rate line is healthy and there is no `camera status=`
# line at all - the capture was filtered too tightly. This is deliberately NOT the
# same as a camera that failed: the capture says nothing whatever about the camera,
# so the honest verdict is that its state is UNKNOWN, not bad. Absent evidence must
# never be reported as a pass, and must not be reported as a contradiction either.
# Expected: CAMERA BLOCKED and no other requirement but EVIDENCE fails. As this file
# stands the synthetic EVIDENCE failure outranks the block, so OVERALL FAIL, exit 1;
# strip this header and the same capture exits 2, which is what a real capture
# missing the camera line would do.
# ============================================================================
